Boolean project-service observations from typescript-eslint 8.70.0 / TypeScript 6.0.3.
Project paths, complete roots, and Program reuse were recorded through parser.parseForESLint.
Unowned observations preserve the missing configured owner; rslint returns a search miss
instead of reproducing the adapter's rejection so callers can apply source-only gap linting.

